    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smyth Naas present 9 Arconagh - a beautifully presented detached residence standing on a private cul de sac in this popular development close to Naas town centre. This fine home boasts very spacious accommodation and stands on a large south-facing corner site with a very private garden to the rear. \r\n\r\nArconagh is convenient to all amenities with shops, shopping centres, schools (both primary and secondary), pubs, restaurants, parks, playgrounds and churches close at hand. The adjacent K Leisure offers a huge range of facilities including an indoor swimming pool. La Vie de Chateau French restaurant, Fauchinos bakery, award winning Osprey Hotel and Spa, Las radas Tapas, Tani Japanese restaurant and Bad habits coffee are nearby and there beautiful canal walks just five minutes stroll away. Everything is within easy walking distance, so you need never take the car out , unless you really want to of course.\r\n\r\nThe Kerry Global centre is a five minute drive. The N7 will take you to the M50 in twenty minutes and the Arrow train service is available from Sallins.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to 137 square meters and comprises entrance hallway, lounge, dining room, breakfast room, kitchen, utility room, four bedrooms (main en-suite), bathroom and guest wc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\n1.91m x 4.85m (6' 3\" x 15' 11\")\r\nPorcelain tiled floor. Decorative coving and centre rose. Dado rail.\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\n0.73m x 1.57m (2' 5\" x 5' 2\")\r\nWith wc and wash hand basin with tiled splashback. Porcelain tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.53m x 4.76m (14' 10\" x 15' 7\")\r\nFeature fireplace with cast iron tiled inset. Solid oak flooring. Dado rail. Decorative coving. Recess lighting. Bay window. Double doors with glazed insets leading to Dining Room.\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\n3.22m x 3.89m (10' 7\" x 12' 9\")\r\nSolid oak flooring. Recess lighting. Fitted display unit. French doors leading to timber decking.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n3.26m x 5.94m (10' 8\" x 19' 6\")\r\nWall and base fitted units with display unit,, shelving and built-in wine rack. Centre island incorporating breakfast bar. Large area of worktop space with double stainless steel sink unit. Plumbed for dishwasher. Integrated Neff oven and Ceran hob with extractor hood. Integrated\r\nNeff microwave oven. Spotlights. Tiled floor. Decorative coving. Archway to Breakfast Room.\r\n\r\nBreakfast Room\r\n2.30m x 3.25m (7' 7\" x 10' 8\")\r\nDual aspect. Decorative coving. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n2.40m x 2.51m (7' 10\" x 8' 3\")\r\nWall and base fitted units. Area of worktop space with stainless steel sink unit. Tiled floor and splashback. Plumbed for washing machine. Door to rear.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n1.88m x 3.77m (6' 2\" x 12' 4\")\r\nHotpress. Dado rail.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.57m x 4.65m (11' 9\" x 15' 3\")\r\nTo front. Wall to wall fitted wardrobes and vanity unit. Bay window.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n0.87m x 2.64m (2' 10\" x 8' 8\")\r\nFully tiled with white wc and wash hand basin with storage. Shower with screen.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.57m x 3.62m (11' 9\" x 11' 11\")\r\nTo rear. Fitted wardrobes and shelving.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.91m x 2.31m (9' 7\" x 7' 7\")\r\nTo rear. Fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n2.90m x 2.54m (9' 6\" x 8' 4\")\r\nTo front. Fitted wardrobe. Fitted shelving.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.67m x 2.05m (5' 6\" x 6' 9\")\r\nFully tiled with white wc, wash hand basin with storage and bath. Triton t90xt electric shower.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nFront: Cobblelock driveway with space for three cars. EV charging point. Soffits with recess lighting. Well stocked flowerbeds. Access on both sides to rear. \r\n\r\nRear: Very private south facing corner garden. Well maintained lawn with mature trees and shrubs. Patio area. Garden shed. Area of timber decking. Outside lighting. Outside tap."
      },
